[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13863.63, "timestamp": "03:51:03", "text": "接下来，我只想确认一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13871.83, "timestamp": "03:51:11", "text": "等等，这人是谁？哦，好吧好吧，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13874.349, "timestamp": "03:51:14", "text": "我没看到“呃”，我看到了，我把它读成了“做”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13886.87, "timestamp": "03:51:26", "text": "是的，确实有一些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13889.71, "timestamp": "03:51:29", "text": "我想要的环境，就像我知道如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13891.149, "timestamp": "03:51:31", "text": "不能太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13894.429, "timestamp": "03:51:34", "text": "有时开放，但有时又过于开放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13896.269, "timestamp": "03:51:36", "text": "不可能是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13900.95, "timestamp": "03:51:40", "text": "很好，我知道我成功着陆了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13902.63, "timestamp": "03:51:42", "text": "方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13906.79, "timestamp": "03:51:46", "text": "是的，有些情况下我能理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13909.309, "timestamp": "03:51:49", "text": "虽然我应该被揭露，即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13911.91, "timestamp": "03:51:51", "text": "它只在流媒体里，这是我唯一能找到的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13914.71, "timestamp": "03:51:54", "text": "谈论我的心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13916.229, "timestamp": "03:51:56", "text": "流动"}]